  "hints": [
    "You know exactly which numbers should be there. What single quantity would change if one of them were removed?",
    "Compute the sum of `0..n` with the formula $n(n+1)/2$, then subtract the sum of the list. What is left is the missing number.",
    "Parallel example: if a class of 30 students has roll numbers 1 to 30 and the attendance sheet adds up to 450 instead of 465, the absent student is number 15."
  ],
